OL,3,GNEWSAFire service tackles large blaze
OL,4,Aat shipyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a large blaze
OL,7,Finvolving about 4,500 tonnes of cars at
OL,8,Fa scrap metal recycling facility in
OL,9,FBelfast's shipyard area.
OL,11,FFive fire appliances and a number of
OL,12,Fspecialist units are at Clearway
OL,13,FDisposals on East Twin Road.
OL,15,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,16,FService (NIFRS) said the blaze was
OL,17,Freported shortly after 12:00 BST on
OL,18,FWednesday and would likely continue
OL,19,Fovernight.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
